# Local agent tooling. The Spec Kit slash commands are reinstalled by
# `specify init`, so they are per-checkout tooling rather than project content.
# Deliberately NOT listing specs/ or tests/ here: both are tracked, and an
# ignore entry over a tracked directory silently drops any NEW file added to it.
.claude/

# Vercel CLI project linkage (created by `vercel link` / `vercel deploy`)
.vercel/
